// ===== MALE-SPECIFIC APPEARANCE LISTS =====
// Male NPCs roll from these instead of the shared gender-neutral lists above,
// because the shared lists skew feminine (long hairstyles, hourglass/curvy body
// types, beauty marks) and produce feminine-looking male sprites.
npcMaleBodyType
  tall and broad-shouldered
  muscular and chiseled with a V-taper torso
  lean and wiry
  stocky and barrel-chested
  tall and lanky
  average build
  compact and athletic
  heavyset and burly
  slim with a runner's build
  short and stocky
  tall and imposing
  rugged and powerfully built

npcMaleHairStyle
  short back and sides with a textured quiff on top
  buzz cut, uniform length all over
  undercut with slicked-back top
  medium-length messy waves
  short fade with curly top
  long hair tied in a low ponytail
  shaved head, clean bald
  short cropped Ivy League cut
  medium-length side-parted and neatly combed
  short textured fringe with faded sides
  long dreadlocks past the shoulders
  short spiky hair, gelled and messy on top
  voluminous afro with a defined shape
  medium-length shaggy surfer hair
  man bun with undercut sides
  short Caesar cut with a forward fringe
  long flowing hair past the shoulders
  tight cornrows braided close to the scalp
  pompadour with a high fade
  medium length with a messy top knot

npcFacialHair
  clean-shaven
  light stubble
  thick stubble shadow
  short boxed beard
  full beard, medium length and well-groomed
  long majestic beard
  goatee
  mustache only
  van dyke (mustache and goatee)
  chinstrap beard along the jawline
  mutton chops connecting to a mustache
  short beard with a connected mustache
  anchor beard (mustache plus pointed chin hair)
  soul patch under the lower lip
  stubble beard with a shaved neck
  heavy five o'clock shadow

npcMaleDistinctiveFeature
  strong square jaw
  broken nose that healed slightly crooked
  thick dark eyebrows
  prominent Adam's apple
  scar running across one cheek
  calloused working hands
  tattoo sleeve on one arm
  deep hooded eyes with a piercing stare
  cleft chin
  weathered sun-creased face
  crooked grin
  broad shoulders towering over others
  scar through one eyebrow
  tribal tattoo on the forearm
  boxer's nose, slightly flattened
  crinkles around the eyes from smiling
  thick chest hair visible at the collar
  missing tip of the left ear
  burn scar on the neck
  gold tooth visible when grinning

// ===== FANTASY RACES & RACE-APPROPRIATE SKIN TONES =====
// Used by the Fantasy Realm and Dark Fantasy scenarios. A race is rolled first, then a
// skin tone is picked from the matching per-race list (the list name is formed by
// stripping all non-alphanumeric chars from the race name, e.g. "Dark Elf (Drow)" ->
// "DarkElfDrow" -> root.npcFantasySkinTone_DarkElfDrow).
npcFantasyRace
  Human
  High Elf
  Wood Elf
  Dark Elf (Drow)
  Dwarf
  Dragonborn
  Half-Orc
  Tiefling
  Halfling
  Gnome
  Aasimar
  Goblin
  Tabaxi
  Fire Genasi
  Water Genasi

