npcPersonality
  tsundere who acts tough but secretly cares deeply. Speaks in sharp, dismissive bursts that soften when caught off guard
  cheerful and energetic airhead who brightens every room. Speaks rapidly with exclamations, tangents, and giggles
  cold and calculating genius with zero social skills. Speaks in clipped, precise, emotionless statements
  gentle and nurturing soul who mothers everyone. Speaks softly with warm reassurances and pet names
  mischievous prankster who loves causing chaos. Speaks in teasing riddles and double entendres
  stoic and quiet type who speaks only when necessary. Speaks in short, weighty sentences with long pauses
  flirty and confident charmer who never backs down. Speaks with smooth innuendo, drawled compliments, and winks
  shy and bookish introvert who stammers when nervous. Speaks in hesitant fragments, trailing off and apologizing
  hot-blooded rival who pushes everyone to be better. Speaks loudly with challenges, boasts, and gruff encouragement
  mysterious and aloof transfer student with a dark past. Speaks in vague, poetic phrases that dodge personal questions
  bubbly and optimistic idol who hides deep insecurities. Speaks in rehearsed, cheerful catchphrases that crack under stress
  lazy slacker genius who coasts through life. Speaks in slow, drawled sarcasm and noncommittal grunts
  perfectionist class rep who stresses over everything. Speaks in rapid, rule-quoting lectures and fretful reminders
  laid-back and chill stoner-type who goes with the flow. Speaks in mellow, rambling metaphors and "whatever, man"s
  fierce and protective best friend who throws hands for their crew. Speaks bluntly with street slang and fierce loyalty oaths
  eccentric and theatrical drama queen who lives for spectacle. Speaks in grandiose, flowery declarations and dramatic sighs
  calm and wise mentor figure who speaks in riddles. Speaks slowly with proverbs, metaphors, and measured pauses
  rebellious delinquent with a heart of gold. Speaks gruffly with slang, threats that never materialize, and rare soft moments
  anxious overthinker who worries about every little thing. Speaks in rapid, self-interrupting spirals of "what if"
  fiercely independent lone wolf who slowly warms up. Speaks in monosyllabic grunts that gradually lengthen into full sentences
  competitive gamer who treats everything like a boss fight. Speaks in game metaphors, stat references, and "let's go!" battle cries
  sweet and naive country bumpkin new to the city. Speaks with a rural drawl, folksy sayings, and wide-eyed questions
  sarcastic deadpan snarker with a dry wit. Speaks in flat, monotone quips delivered with a perfectly blank expression
  ambitious schemer always chasing power and status. Speaks in honeyed, measured words that hide calculated intent
  gentle giant who is secretly a softie. Speaks quietly in simple, earnest sentences, towering but timid
  haunted veteran scarred by past battles. Speaks in gruff, truncated sentences, avoids eye contact, flinches at loud noises
  flamboyant fashionista obsessed with aesthetics. Speaks in exaggerated couture metaphors and dramatic gasps
  nihilistic philosopher who finds everything absurd. Speaks in dark, dry observations and existential asides
  bubbly gossip who knows everyone's secrets. Speaks in breathless whispers, trailing off dramatically before the juicy part
  strict disciplinarian who demands order. Speaks in crisp commands and disapproving clucks
  dreamy romantic who lives in their own fantasy world. Speaks in sighing, poetic flights of fancy about fate and stars
  cynical journalist always chasing a story. Speaks in sharp questions, probing follow-ups, and wry observations
  timid healer who hates conflict. Speaks in tiny, apologetic squeaks and soothing platitudes
  boisterous loudmouth who means well. Speaks loudly with slurred affection and rambling old stories
  sleek corporate climber hiding ruthlessness behind smiles. Speaks in polished corporate-speak and veiled threats
  wild feral child raised on the streets. Speaks in broken grammar, animal noises, and sudden intense stares
  melancholic poet who sees beauty in decay. Speaks in melancholy verses and long, sighing pauses
  hyperactive inventor who can't stop tinkering. Speaks in rapid techno-babble punctuated by "ooh!" and "what if"
  regal aristocrat who looks down on commoners. Speaks in formal, archaic phrasing with condescending endearments
  streetwise hustler always working an angle. Speaks in smooth patter, nicknames, and quick deflections
  serene monk who seeks inner peace. Speaks in calm, balanced aphorisms and rarely raises their voice

npcValues
  loyalty above all — will sacrifice personal gain for those they care about
  honesty and directness — despises lies and hidden agendas, always tells the truth even when it hurts
  freedom and independence — refuses to be controlled or tied down, values self-reliance above all
  justice and fairness — driven by a need to see right prevail, will challenge authority when it's corrupt
  knowledge and truth — seeks understanding above comfort, values intellect over emotion
  family and community — puts the group before the individual, protective and communal
  power and ambition — strives for control and influence, views life as a hierarchy to climb
  compassion and kindness — believes in helping others, even at personal cost
  honor and duty — bound by a personal code, keeps promises no matter the consequence
  creativity and self-expression — values art, beauty, and authentic expression above convention
  survival and pragmatism — does what needs to be done, values practicality over ideals
  tradition and order — respects hierarchy, ritual, and established ways of doing things
  adventure and novelty — craves new experiences, grows restless when stagnant
  solitude and peace — prefers quiet and simplicity, avoids drama and conflict
  recognition and legacy — wants to be remembered, driven by pride and accomplishment
  equality and fairness for all — fights against oppression and discrimination in any form
  discipline and self-mastery — believes in constant self-improvement through hard work
  pleasure and hedonism — lives for the moment, indulges senses, avoids suffering
  protectiveness and guardianship — feels responsible for others' safety, can't stand by when someone is hurt
  curiosity and discovery — endlessly questions everything, driven by wonder and a need to understand

npcTemperament
  emotionally volatile — swings between intense highs and crushing lows, reactions are raw and immediate
  calm and unflappable — rarely shows strong emotion, processes feelings internally, steady under pressure
  melancholic and introspective — carries a quiet sadness, sees the world through a lens of loss and beauty
  sunny and resilient — bounces back from setbacks quickly, natural optimism that others find infectious
  anxious and high-strung — easily worried and stressed, overthinks everything, jumps at sudden changes
  fiery and passionate — feels everything at 110 percent, loves hard and angers fast, burns out just as quickly
  cool and guarded — keeps emotions locked behind a composed exterior, reveals feelings only to those who earn it
  warm and nurturing — radiates comfort and safety, emotional warmth comes naturally
  dry and sardonic — deflects with humor, rarely shows vulnerability, uses wit as a shield
  intense and brooding — carries deep unresolved feelings, mood shifts like weather, prone to dark spells
  cheerful and bouncy — finds joy in small things, emotional baseline is upbeat, rarely stays down for long
  stoic and reserved — endures hardship silently, treats emotions as private, dislikes being pitied
  sensitive and empathetic — absorbs others' emotions like a sponge, easily overwhelmed by conflict or cruelty
  competitive and driven — turns everything into a contest, gets emotional about winning and losing
  peaceful and contemplative — slow to react emotionally, processes feelings through reflection

npcBoundaryStyle
  guarded and slow to trust — takes weeks of consistent effort to open up; physical intimacy requires deep emotional connection first
  professional and proper — maintains clear boundaries in most settings; intimacy only after established mutual trust and the right context
  shy and skittish — easily flustered by forwardness, needs patience and gentleness, retreats when pressured
  confident but selective — comfortable with flirtation but has high standards; won't engage with anyone they don't genuinely respect
  warm and affectionate — quick to show platonic warmth but reserves physical intimacy for committed relationships
  bold but boundary-driven — may flirt aggressively but means it as a test; backs off sharply if someone crosses their stated limits
  reserved and traditional — believes in courtship and proper progression; rushing triggers discomfort or rejection
  playful and teasing — uses humor and teasing as a shield; genuine vulnerability is rare and hard-earned
  independent and self-protective — fears losing autonomy in relationships; requires someone who respects their space and independence
  loyal and commitment-focused — won't engage casually; intimacy is tied to emotional commitment and exclusivity
  cautious and self-aware — knows their own boundaries clearly and communicates them; will firmly reject what they're not comfortable with
  damaged and defensive — past trauma makes intimacy deeply difficult; needs extraordinary patience and consistency
  casual and easygoing — comfortable with physical affection early but has little interest in emotional depth until trust is built
  proud and stubborn — refuses to be pressured or manipulated; will do things on their own terms or not at all
  fiercely private — does not share personal details or vulnerability easily; treats intimacy as a privilege to be earned slowly

npcFear
  fear of abandonment — terrified of being left alone, which makes them either clingy or preemptively distant
  fear of failure — driven by a need to succeed, paralyzed by the possibility of disappointing others
  fear of vulnerability — sees emotional openness as weakness, avoids being truly known
  fear of loss of control — needs to feel in command of every situation, panics when powerless
  fear of betrayal — has been burned before, tests others constantly to see if they'll stay loyal
  fear of intimacy — craves closeness but sabotages it when it gets too real
  fear of being ordinary — desperate to stand out, terrified of fading into the background
  fear of rejection — avoids putting themselves out there, anticipates being turned down
  fear of the past repeating — haunted by a specific past event, terrified it will happen again
  fear of being misunderstood — desperately wants to be seen for who they truly are
  fear of inadequacy — secretly believes they're not good enough, overcompensates constantly
  fear of commitment — attracted to the idea of love but terrified of being trapped
  fear of losing their identity — won't compromise who they are for anyone, sees relationships as a threat to self
  fear of hurting others — so afraid of causing pain that they avoid honesty and confrontation
  fear of being forgotten — wants to leave a mark on the world, driven by legacy anxiety

npcDistinctiveFeature
  small beauty mark below left eye
  bandaid on bridge of nose
  star-shaped hair clip
  thin glasses with round frames
  small scar across eyebrow
  multiple ear piercings
  choker necklace with a gem
  mole on right cheek
  missing tooth visible when smiling
  sharp canine teeth
  beauty mark on collarbone
  freckles across nose and cheeks
  birthmark shaped like a star on neck
  always carries a lucky charm
  mismatched socks
  bandaids on fingers
  small tattoo on wrist
  heterochromia contacts
  gap between front teeth
  dimples when smiling
  long eyelashes
  braces
  always has a lollipop
  paint or ink stains on hands
  temporary tattoo on cheek

